Template: datum-gateway/bitcoin-address
Type: string
_Description: The Bitcoin address used for mining:
 By default, this Bitcoin address is overridden by the usernames of miners, 
 meaning it is used solely as a fallback in the event of a pool disconnection.

Template: datum-gateway/password
Type: note
_Description: Password for the API: ${PASSWORD}
 This password will be asked when accessing the web UI

Template: datum-gateway/log
Type: boolean
Default: false
_Description: Do you want to enable logs in /var/log/datum-gateway ?
 This is particularly useful for system that doesn't use systemd.

Template: datum-gateway/blocknotify
Type: boolean
Default: true
_Description: Do you want to add the blocknotify option in the bitcoin.conf?
 This is very highly recommended to avoid mining stale work.

Template: datum-gateway/coinbase-tag-secondary
Type: string
_Description: The secondary tag used in the coinbase transaction:
 This tag will be added in the coinbase transaction, it can be anything. 
 Leave it blank if you want to use the default

Template: datum-gateway/blocknotify-fail
Type: error
_Description: Couldn't configure blocknotify automatically
 please add "blocknotify=killall -USR1 datum_gateway" to your bitcoin.conf"

Template: datum-gateway/bitcoin-address-blank
Type: note
_Description: No Bitcoin address entered
 you can still configure it in the config file/GUI.

Template: datum-gateway/work_update_seconds
Type: string
_Description: Work update interval in seconds:
 How many seconds between normal work updates.
 Must be a number between 5 and 120.

Template: datum-gateway/listen_port
Type: string
_Description: Listen port:
 Listening port for Stratum Gateway.
 Must be a number between 5 and 65535.

Template: datum-gateway/max_clients_per_thread
Type: string
_Description: Maximum clients per Stratum server thread:
 Must be a number higher than 0.

Template: datum-gateway/max_threads
Type: string
_Description: Maximum Stratum server threads:
 Must be a number between 1 and 64.

Template: datum-gateway/max_clients
Type: string
_Description: Maximum clients:
 Maximum total Stratum clients before rejecting connections.
 Must be a number higher than 0.

Template: datum-gateway/vardiff_min
Type: string
_Description: Work difficulty floor:
 Must be a power of two.

Template: datum-gateway/coinbase_tag_primary
Type: string
_Description: The primary tag used in the coinbase transaction:
 This tag will be added in the coinbase transaction, it can be anything.
 The primary tag will be overridden by the pool if mining in pooled mode.

Template: datum-gateway/modify_conf
Type: boolean
_Description: Should the config be modifiable from the dashboard?
 Enable modifying the config file from API/dashboard.

Template: datum-gateway/log_level_file
Type: string
_Description: Log level for log file:
 Minimum log level for log file messages 
 (0=All, 1=Debug, 2=Info, 3=Warn, 4=Error, 5=Fatal)

Template: datum-gateway/pool_pass_workers
Type: boolean
_Description: Pass workers to pool?
 Pass stratum miner usernames as sub-worker names to the pool.

Template: datum-gateway/pool_pass_full_users
Type: boolean
_Description: Pass stratum miner usernames as raw usernames to the pool?
 Use if putting multiple payout addresses on miners behind this gateway.

Template: datum-gateway/pooled_mining_only
Type: boolean
_Description: Pooled mining only?
 If the DATUM pool server becomes unavailable, terminate miner connections 
 (otherwise, 100% of any blocks you find pay mining.pool_address)